    "updated_at": "2026-08-25T06:39:31Z",
    "body": "Surprisingly this is another novel crash in the same area. This part of the parser is extremely fragile it seems. #12830 fixes this. Though there's more to do for implementations that want to keep customized built-in elements: https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/12828.",
